<?php if($tab==='whatsapp'):?><form method="post" class="row"><?=csrf_field()?><input type="hidden" name="a" value="test_wa"><input name="to" placeholder="Your WhatsApp number" required><button class="btn"><?=icon('wa')?>Send test</button></form><div class="card"><h4>Which method should I use?</h4><ul class="ul"><li><b>Manual</b> – free, no setup. After the report is ready, click <i>Send on WhatsApp</i> on a lead: WhatsApp opens with the message and report link filled in. Status is tracked.</li><li><b>WhatsApp Cloud API</b> – official & fully automatic. Create an app at developers.facebook.com → WhatsApp, add your number, create a permanent token (System User) and an approved <i>Utility/Marketing</i> template with a <b>Document</b> header. Set the webhook URL above for delivery/read/reply tracking.</li><li><b>Other provider</b> – Interakt, WATI, AiSensy, UltraMsg, Whapi etc. Copy the "send document" API from their docs into the URL/headers/body fields using the placeholders.</li></ul></div><?php endif?>
